<title>SINGAPORE: RESEARCH ALERT: Subscribe to Delifrance IPO - DBS.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT: Subscribe to Delifrance IPO - DBS.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1996-10-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>DBS Investment Research said on Monday it recommended subscribing to the initial public offer (IPO) of Delifrance Asia Ltd.</p>
<p>Delifrance, a French-style cafe and bakeries chain, said last week it was offering 45.16 million shares at a price of Singapore $0.78 each.</p>
<p>DBS said in its daily bulletin a fair value of the stock would be between S$0.80 and S$0.85.</p>
<p>&quot;Delifrance is a highly visible stock -- as such, the retail interest in it may be strong,&quot; the bulletin said.</p>
<p>-- Singapore newsroom 65-8703080</p>
